@ [canonical_uuid] 5f178438-8dad-4d96-be46-66c75b881f1b

& [ConstructiveHemisphere]
  + an exact update proposal can become a governed physical workflow only when every stage commission names its producer capability roots resources verifier consequence and unresolved frontier
  + current Phase3A semantics can supply the fresh-admission gate
  + historical Phase3B and Phase3C knowledge supplies a mature prevention-detection path and independent-evidence threat vocabulary
  + separately commissioned B0 through B5 stages allow provider-free protocol work to precede target-host physical proof
  + immutable evidence and independent deterministic gates create a truthful input for later SWA-05 publication consideration

& [CriticalHemisphere]
  + a structurally valid saved receipt can be stale unauthenticated and physically false
  + a read-only working adapter does not prove workspace-write containment
  + App Server schemas and notifications do not prove host enforcement or complete post-state
  + a stopped parent may leave descendants or late writes
  + a direct inventory can be incomplete unstable aliased or unable to exclude an external writer
  + a reviewer can be captured by mutable state shared identity or authority overlap
  + a rollback command can fail partially create new residue or merely appear successful
  + accepted evidence can be laundered into commit push activation or self-signature if downstream denial is not structural

& [ConflictResolution]
  + freshness requires new authenticated Phase3A observation and single-use claim
  + host claims remain activation prerequisites with independent target-host proof
  + events remain reactive and post-state comes from independent direct observation
  + child descendant late-write and quiescence uncertainty remain explicit consequences
  + reviewer receives immutable inputs and a complete capability partition excluding writer rollback publisher and signer powers
  + rollback is a separately commissioned attempt followed by the same independent observation grammar
  + HandoffToSWA05 carries evidence identity only and cannot carry Git or activation authority

& [FalseOptionsRejected]
  + one monolithic broker object containing all handles and capabilities
  + metadata bearer token that unlocks a hidden global executor
  + writer-declared diff as authoritative state
  + passing tests as automatic acceptance
  + acceptance as automatic commit or push
  + reset checkout clean or delete as implicit rollback
  + a synthetic provider-free run labeled as physical product update
  + current untracked draft import as an expedient source

& [Conclusion]
  + the two hemispheres converge only on complete formation with physical activation absent
  + B0 pure protocol is the smallest later implementation candidate because it can prove governance mechanics without a runtime handle
  + B1 through B5 remain independently source lock proof review and signature gated
